"Long ago Ogarius implanted enchantments in Esebus citizens that turn them into spider monsters."
"His dream mana can mirror two places to teleport, seed false positions, and store attacks."
"Later, he sends assassins after Nathan Lark before Nathan can leave his continent."
"Years later, in Esebus, Nathan blocks his escape and Stella's hydrabane burns him to death."
"His defeat lets Garna take and consolidate Estefar."
"He returns, and in the Ostren war tries a dream-portal, then flees leaving an illusion."
